{"scene_id": "s02018", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02018.fountain", "heading": "INT. ORBITAL ARCHIVE STATION, READING ROOM - CONTINUOUS CYCLE", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ARCHIVIST PELAGIA ONWUACHI-VANDERMEER", "names": ["ARCHIVIST PELAGIA ONWUACHI-VANDERMEER", "PELAGIA"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 14}, {"id": 1, "name": "VISITOR", "names": ["VISITOR"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 21}, {"id": 2, "name": "YOUNG SCHOLAR", "names": ["YOUNG SCHOLAR"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 3, "name": "THEODOSIA AMARI-KOWALSKI", "names": ["THEODOSIA AMARI-KOWALSKI", "THEODOSIA"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 4, "name": "LIBRARY AUTOMATON", "names": ["LIBRARY AUTOMATON", "AUTOMATON"], "gender": "?", "first": 8, "spoke": 6}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ORBITAL ARCHIVE STATION, READING ROOM - CONTINUOUS CYCLE", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A quiet room of brass and glass, the curve of a viewport showing slow clouds of a gas giant.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Rows of reading carrels.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Archival drawers set into the walls like ship's lockers.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "A brass clock ticks, though no tide exists here to measure.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "ARCHIVIST PELAGIA ONWUACHI-VANDERMEER (60s, gray tunic, white gloves) shelves a folio.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "At a carrel, a VISITOR (40s, unmarked jumpsuit, a leather satchel, polite eyes) turns the pages of a bound volume with the care of one afraid to wake it.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "At another carrel sits a YOUNG SCHOLAR, THEODOSIA AMARI-KOWALSKI (20s, ink-stained fingers, tangled hair) taking notes.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Across the aisle, a LIBRARY AUTOMATON, a squat brass construct with a single lens, rolls on silent wheels.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Visitor. You've been in that volume for three days.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is a long volume.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's forty pages.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They are dense pages.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "May I ask what you are looking for?", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A name.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Whose?", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My grandfather's.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Pelagia sets down her folio.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Adjusts a glove.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He was a colonist?", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He was a cartographer. On the survey ship Meridian.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The Meridian was lost.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eighty years ago.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eighty-one.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "The Automaton rolls to a stop beside the Visitor.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Its lens irises.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Query. Do you require assistance?", "name": "AUTOMATON", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No, thank you.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Query. Is the volume satisfactory?", "name": "AUTOMATON", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Noted.", "name": "AUTOMATON", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "It rolls away.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Theodosia lifts her head and watches it go.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's never done that before.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["whispering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's learning.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's what worries me.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The Visitor turns another page.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Stops.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "His finger rests on a line of tiny script.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "He doesn't speak.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Pelagia crosses to him, quiet, and reads over his shoulder.", "para": 6, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ah.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "\"Cartographer Imre Teague-Oyelaran. Last known position: sector nine.\"", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Last known.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Last known is not final.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No. But it is as far as the records go.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Theodosia rises from her carrel and joins them.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "The three of them look at the page: the Archivist, the Visitor, the scholar.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sector nine is where the Reach begins.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody goes into the Reach.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My grandfather did.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Perhaps you should wait for the next survey.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["together"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Perhaps you should wait for the next survey.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["together"], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "They glance at each other.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "The Visitor smiles faintly.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I have waited eighty-one years.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is not you who waited.", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No. But I inherited the habit.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "He closes the volume gently, rests his palm on the cover, and sits there a long moment while the clock ticks and the clouds of the giant planet turn in the window.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Would you like tea?", "name": "PELAGIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Please.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "She goes to fetch it.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Theodosia hesitates, then pulls out the chair beside him and sits.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I could go with you.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To the Reach?", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To the next archive. There's a copy of the Meridian's log in Tycho Station.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I would like that.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Good.", "name": "THEODOSIA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "The Automaton returns, bearing a tray: a pot, three cups.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "It sets it on the carrel.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tea, Visitor.", "name": "AUTOMATON", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the Automaton, amused"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You are welcome, Imre.", "name": "AUTOMATON", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "The Visitor goes completely still.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Pelagia, at the end of the aisle, stops with her hand on a drawer.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Theodosia looks from the Automaton to him.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not my name.", "name": "VISITOR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["slowly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is in the log.", "name": "AUTOMATON", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}